  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a name=\"top\"></a></span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_t.gif\" height=\"25\" width=\"630\"> <p><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"24\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/u.gif\" width=\"24\">O. \n                            Combat&amp;Jobs</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_m.gif\" height=\"39\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:60%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background_1.gif\" height=\"22\">\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"590\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background.gif\">\n<p><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_vet_carto/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">지도해석(Cartograhpy)</font></a></span><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> \n                            l </span></font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_vet_carto_1/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">스킬도표</font></span></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> \n                            l </span></font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/tmap/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">보물지도</font></span></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> \n                            l </span></font><a href=\"/site/skill_knowhow/uo_knowhow_tmap/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">보물지도(대륙)</font></span></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> \n                            l </span></font><a href=\"/site/skill_knowhow/uo_knowhow_tmapi/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">보물지도(섬)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">자물쇠따기(Lockpicking) l </span></font><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">트랩해체(Remove \n                            Trap)</font></span></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#999933\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"530\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"16\" width=\"492\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;몬스터별 \n\n                            지도를 획득 할 수 있는 레벨분류</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"76\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#105085\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">1렙지도</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"412\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Ore Elementals, Earth Elementals, Ettins, Fire Gargoyles, Gargoyles, Gazers, \n\nliches*, Ogres, Ophidian Enforcers, Ophidian Warriors, Orcs, Orcish Lords, Orc \n\nMages, Sea Serpents (낚시로 건져올린), Terathan Warriors, Trolls.</span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">(리치는 보통3렙을 \n\n                            주지만 흔하지 않게 1렙도 줍니다)</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"76\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#105085\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">2렙지도</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"412\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Air Elementals, Drakes, Fire Elementals, Frost Trolls, </span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Ophidian Apprentice \n\nMages, Ophidian Shaman, Reapers, </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Sea Serpents (일반적으로 \n\n                            리스펀된), Snow \n\nElementals, Stone Gargoyles, Water Elementals, Wyverns</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"76\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#105085\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">3렙지도</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"412\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Arctic Ogre Lords, Cyclopean Warriors, Cyclops, Dread Spiders, </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Efreets, \n\nLiches*, Ogre Lords, Ophidian Avengers, </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Ophidian Knight-Errants, </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Snow \n\nElementals, Terathan Avengers.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"76\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#105085\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">4렙지도</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"412\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Daemons, Dragons, Ice Fiends, Krakens, Lich Lords, Ophidian Matriarchs, Terathan \n\nMatriarchs, White Wyrms.</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"76\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#105085\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">5렙지도</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"412\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Ancient Liches, Ancient Wyrms, Balrons, Blood Elementals, Poison Elementals, \n\nShadow Wyrms, Titans.</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"492\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;이름으로 \n\n                            알 수 있는 지도별 레벨분류</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"76\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#105085\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">1렙지도</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"412\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">간결하게 \n\n                            그려진 낡은 보물지도</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"76\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#105085\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">2렙지도</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"412\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">잘그려진 \n\n                            낡은 보물지도</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"76\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#105085\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">3렙지도</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"412\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">숙달된솜씨로 \n\n                            그려진 낡은 보물지도</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"76\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#105085\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">4렙지도</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"412\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">교묘하게 \n\n                            그려진 낡은 보물지도</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"76\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#105085\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">5렙지도</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"412\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">사악하게 \n\n                            그려진 낡은 보물지도</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"492\">\n<p><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;다른이가 \n\n                            이미 해독이 된상태이면 \"</span></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">낡은</span></b></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"이라는 단어가 \n\n                            사라집니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#999933\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"300\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"291\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;카토스킬별 \n\n                            해독할 수 있는  지도</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"41\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">레벨</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"246\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">카토그라피스킬</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"41\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Lv1</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"246\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"blue\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"